WEBVTT

00:00:00.894 --> 00:00:04.594
Pre-Festival Event

00:00:16.144 --> 00:00:20.674
Starting here, the pacing of the
lines should match Joan's...

00:00:21.414 --> 00:00:22.744
Miss Senkoji...

00:00:27.424 --> 00:00:28.484
Miss Kozuki.

00:00:29.054 --> 00:00:30.524
Working late again?

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:32.584
Are you going to have enough time?

00:00:32.764 --> 00:00:34.254
Er... yes.

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:35.724
I'm okay.

00:00:36.564 --> 00:00:37.734
Is something wrong?

00:00:37.734 --> 00:00:39.404
You okay, Michi?

00:00:39.404 --> 00:00:41.924
I-I'm okay! Really!

00:00:44.104 --> 00:00:45.644
Well, that's good.

00:00:45.644 --> 00:00:46.934
Don't overwork yourself!

00:00:49.444 --> 00:00:50.604
Miss Kozuki?

00:00:51.014 --> 00:00:52.044
Michi?

00:00:52.044 --> 00:00:55.604
I see the two of you worked things out!

00:00:56.724 --> 00:00:58.054
Oh...

00:00:58.054 --> 00:00:59.114
Yes...

00:00:59.254 --> 00:01:02.714
I'm sure we can make this play a success!

00:01:03.424 --> 00:01:04.224
Yes.

00:01:04.224 --> 00:01:05.664
Of course!

00:01:08.064 --> 00:01:10.794
Miss Senkoji, and Mari...

00:01:11.664 --> 00:01:18.434
I really want to thank you for
everything you've done!

00:01:20.544 --> 00:01:21.844
Michi...

00:01:22.344 --> 00:01:23.714
Miss Kozuki...

00:01:26.644 --> 00:01:27.984
So warm...

00:01:28.514 --> 00:01:30.314
You're funny, Michi!

00:01:39.664 --> 00:01:40.734
Chemistry Lab

00:01:40.734 --> 00:01:41.834
Chemistry Lab
Sugawara speaking.

00:01:41.834 --> 00:01:43.804
Chemistry Lab
The Security Department. It's urgent.

00:01:43.804 --> 00:01:45.634
Chemistry Lab
Hello? Hello?

00:01:48.334 --> 00:01:49.894
What's going on?

00:01:53.844 --> 00:01:55.504
The SC just took off.

00:01:56.074 --> 00:01:59.374
Eagle One, report your status! Eagle One!

00:02:00.154 --> 00:02:03.084
This is Eagle One. I've never seen
a formation like this...

00:02:10.624 --> 00:02:13.154
Shubel launching 3rd attack platoon!

00:02:14.134 --> 00:02:16.724
The Forime are launching a feeble
attempt at self-defense.

00:02:18.004 --> 00:02:19.224
Destroy them.

00:02:19.304 --> 00:02:20.574
Roger!

00:02:20.574 --> 00:02:23.804
Attention all fighters:
Eliminate Forime resistance!

00:02:36.924 --> 00:02:38.924
103rd
Kaio Festival

00:02:38.924 --> 00:02:39.324
Staff Room

00:02:39.324 --> 00:02:40.594
Staff Room
Good morning.

00:02:41.054 --> 00:02:42.614
Oh, good morning.

00:02:43.564 --> 00:02:45.064
What's wrong?

00:02:45.064 --> 00:02:49.964
She has an important call
and it won't go through.

00:02:51.134 --> 00:02:52.294
Oh, please!

00:02:54.734 --> 00:02:56.174
That's odd...

00:02:56.874 --> 00:02:58.104
Something wrong?

00:02:58.904 --> 00:03:00.634
It's the TV.

00:03:00.744 --> 00:03:03.044
None of the stations work.

00:03:03.714 --> 00:03:06.184
We are currently experiencing technical
difficulties. Thank you for your patience.

00:03:06.684 --> 00:03:12.054
The students have been working hard
to bring their projects to fruition.

00:03:12.154 --> 00:03:20.494
Friends and family, we hope you'll
enjoy the fruits of their labors.

00:03:20.864 --> 00:03:24.324
Now, let the festivities begin!

00:03:34.074 --> 00:03:36.174
Shimakaze and Ayama are both sunk!

00:03:36.514 --> 00:03:37.944
Where are they shooting from?!

00:03:38.584 --> 00:03:40.074
What on earth are those rays?

00:03:40.584 --> 00:03:42.244
Here it comes! They're targeting us now!

00:03:42.314 --> 00:03:43.214
What?!

00:03:43.214 --> 00:03:44.254
Overhead at 12 o'clock!

00:03:44.254 --> 00:03:45.514
Retreat!

00:03:47.194 --> 00:03:48.884
It's no use! We'll never make it!

00:04:01.034 --> 00:04:02.734
What on earth is that?!

00:04:03.374 --> 00:04:05.634
Elbolu attack intercepted.

00:04:06.004 --> 00:04:10.634
Aim for their engine.
Shift immediately after firing!

00:04:10.844 --> 00:04:11.814
Roger.

00:04:19.724 --> 00:04:22.024
Ship Five has emerged! They're firing at us!

00:04:22.454 --> 00:04:24.854
Conduct an emergency evasion
and fire back immediately!

00:04:37.144 --> 00:04:40.764
Direct hit to engine.
Elbolu has been destroyed.

00:04:41.614 --> 00:04:44.584
Energy reserves are at 25%.

00:04:45.314 --> 00:04:47.044
Three more ships.

00:04:48.254 --> 00:04:52.444
Somehow, I have to hold them off until
the play's done! For the commander's sake...

00:04:54.554 --> 00:04:58.514
That concludes the 10th Grade Orange
Blossom's choral performance.

00:04:58.794 --> 00:05:00.354
It's finally time!

00:05:00.534 --> 00:05:01.364
Yes...

00:05:01.364 --> 00:05:02.634
I'm so nervous!

00:05:02.634 --> 00:05:06.704
Next is a joint project by the 11th Grade Cherry
Blossoms and Blue Sea Dorm.

00:05:06.704 --> 00:05:12.604
Maiden of Orleans, an original play
by Michiko Kozuki.

00:05:16.914 --> 00:05:18.244
We've lost Ship Four!

00:05:18.584 --> 00:05:21.414
Ship Five keeps teleporting as they attack!

00:05:24.324 --> 00:05:25.304
Warning!

00:05:25.684 --> 00:05:29.354
Suspected physical warhead
approaching at high-speed.

00:05:30.154 --> 00:05:32.624
Turning ship for emergency evasion.

00:05:32.624 --> 00:05:33.784
Don't turn!

00:05:33.894 --> 00:05:36.294
Maintain course!
Open thrusters full-throttle!

00:05:36.294 --> 00:05:39.364
Roll ship to evade the shot while
calculating attacker's location!

00:05:39.364 --> 00:05:40.424
Roger.

00:05:40.634 --> 00:05:42.334
Calculating phase data.

00:05:42.504 --> 00:05:44.594
We'll strike back before they can escape!

00:05:47.144 --> 00:05:48.614
Calculations complete.

00:05:48.874 --> 00:05:51.404
Location determined. Aiming cannons.

00:05:51.984 --> 00:05:53.104
Fire!

00:05:54.714 --> 00:05:56.844
Kelbil is hit! Unable to navigate!

00:05:57.254 --> 00:05:59.684
Ship Five is still operational!

00:06:01.224 --> 00:06:03.154
They'll expose themselves in time...

00:06:04.024 --> 00:06:08.124
...and we'll eliminate this Forime
along with the data!

00:06:08.934 --> 00:06:11.364
Set a course for the western end
of the archepelago!

00:06:11.434 --> 00:06:12.564
Roger!

00:06:12.564 --> 00:06:15.664
Attention both ships: Proceed to western end
of archepelago at full speed!

00:06:18.404 --> 00:06:20.034
No!

00:06:25.984 --> 00:06:27.004
I was dreaming?

00:06:28.754 --> 00:06:31.014
What? Where am I?

00:06:31.484 --> 00:06:33.894
Hey! Somebody! Help!

00:06:33.894 --> 00:06:35.284
Who goes there?

00:06:36.994 --> 00:06:42.394
Who disturbs the quiet of my cell?

00:06:51.444 --> 00:06:54.174
Who are you?

00:06:57.944 --> 00:06:59.644
Fox Two, Fire!

00:07:02.714 --> 00:07:04.584
Damn. There's too many of them!

00:07:12.164 --> 00:07:14.864
"Have you not heard of Joan of Arc,

00:07:14.864 --> 00:07:17.834
once hailed as our country's savior,

00:07:17.834 --> 00:07:19.804
now imprisoned on charges of heresy?"

00:07:33.814 --> 00:07:35.314
Low flier to Bogey Five!

00:07:35.314 --> 00:07:36.714
We can't reach from here!

00:07:44.094 --> 00:07:46.084
Multiple Arume craft overhead.

00:07:46.324 --> 00:07:49.494
I know that! Somehow, I have to...

00:07:50.664 --> 00:07:55.264
I have to protect the commander!

00:07:59.844 --> 00:08:00.844
Attention, please!

00:08:00.844 --> 00:08:03.974
We've been ordered to evacuate!
Please calmly proceed to the exits!

00:08:04.214 --> 00:08:06.704
What's this, Miss Sugawara?

00:08:07.254 --> 00:08:09.244
Honestly, your class is always...

00:08:14.924 --> 00:08:17.054
This isn't trick photography or an edited image.

00:08:17.294 --> 00:08:22.254
Just as you see here, UFOs have
suddenly filled the sky above Tokyo.

00:08:22.964 --> 00:08:28.564
The US, Europe, and countries around the
world are broadcasting similar reports.

00:08:30.304 --> 00:08:34.174
The bottoms of the UFOs are opening
and something's dropping out!

00:08:35.514 --> 00:08:39.344
They're girls! Millions of girls are
floating down through the sky!

00:08:39.914 --> 00:08:41.154
Get closer!

00:08:41.154 --> 00:08:43.054
I'm as close as I can get!

00:08:43.184 --> 00:08:44.344
Damn!

00:08:45.024 --> 00:08:46.284
Hey! Over there!

00:09:19.154 --> 00:09:20.454
Michi...

00:09:26.724 --> 00:09:28.094
You girls!

00:09:28.794 --> 00:09:30.924
What are you doing, Miss Kozuki?

00:09:31.004 --> 00:09:32.934
Hurry up and evacuate!

00:09:33.464 --> 00:09:35.094
Get out of the building, now!

00:09:35.634 --> 00:09:37.404
But we worked so hard...

00:09:38.174 --> 00:09:40.974
I'm sorry. We've ruined everything.

00:09:41.714 --> 00:09:42.904
Hagino...

00:09:43.674 --> 00:09:48.114
I wanted to at least make it
through the play, but...

00:09:49.814 --> 00:09:51.154
Hagino...

00:09:51.884 --> 00:09:53.444
Miss Senkoji...

00:09:59.364 --> 00:10:01.624
Miss Senkoji, you...

00:10:01.934 --> 00:10:03.164
Hagino?

00:10:03.164 --> 00:10:04.864
What's going on?

00:10:05.104 --> 00:10:06.654
Lady Hagino!

00:10:14.244 --> 00:10:16.714
I'm sorry I mislead you all.

00:10:17.614 --> 00:10:20.414
This is who I really am.

00:10:30.094 --> 00:10:32.954
I'll try to divert the fighting
away from the school.

00:10:38.034 --> 00:10:39.934
Please protect them, Teacher.

00:10:41.204 --> 00:10:43.134
Yes! All right, girls...

00:10:44.344 --> 00:10:45.604
Hagino!

00:10:49.874 --> 00:10:53.174
You'll come back again, won't you?

00:10:59.154 --> 00:11:00.454
Good-bye.

00:11:13.734 --> 00:11:15.104
Hagino?

00:11:30.824 --> 00:11:32.154
Hagino is...

00:11:32.524 --> 00:11:33.954
...an alien?

00:11:34.824 --> 00:11:38.124
So she was a spy?

00:11:38.264 --> 00:11:42.754
How could she! Starting a war all of
a sudden, and then just running off!

00:11:43.064 --> 00:11:49.164
The city's a mess, and the school
festival is... is...

00:11:49.334 --> 00:11:50.604
That's not true!

00:11:56.274 --> 00:11:57.644
Michi...

00:11:58.384 --> 00:12:07.554
Miss Senkoji... Miss Senkoji must
have left to protect us!

00:12:08.824 --> 00:12:16.784
After all, she was more dedicated
to the play than anyone!

00:12:17.464 --> 00:12:20.064
She promised we'd make it happen together!

00:12:22.534 --> 00:12:28.804
She may not be from Earth,
but of course she's not a spy!

00:12:29.344 --> 00:12:33.974
The smartest student in school...
an athletic and academic super-star...

00:12:35.014 --> 00:12:42.014
How could the Miss Senkoji we know be a spy?!

00:12:45.464 --> 00:12:48.364
All right, everyone!
Head for the woods behind the school!

00:12:54.134 --> 00:12:55.294
Mari?

00:12:59.644 --> 00:13:00.904
Mari?

00:13:09.914 --> 00:13:10.974
Our status?

00:13:11.184 --> 00:13:18.254
We've managed to eliminate Ships Two through
Four, but Novaal is currently headed this way.

00:13:18.824 --> 00:13:22.054
We'll have to put an end to this.

00:13:22.564 --> 00:13:24.394
Um... Commander?

00:13:24.704 --> 00:13:25.994
Yes?

00:13:26.204 --> 00:13:28.694
I'm so sorry.

00:13:29.074 --> 00:13:30.064
What for?

00:13:30.704 --> 00:13:35.204
I wasn't able to protect the festival.

00:13:38.514 --> 00:13:40.004
It's all right.

00:13:40.384 --> 00:13:43.784
It was just a selfish request.

00:13:47.254 --> 00:13:52.124
You did an excellent job.
Thank you, Tsubael.

00:13:54.734 --> 00:13:55.824
Of course.

00:13:59.334 --> 00:14:01.734
Blue, take off!

00:14:02.034 --> 00:14:03.804
Blue, taking off.

00:14:07.514 --> 00:14:08.904
Ship Five surfacing!

00:14:09.514 --> 00:14:14.174
Your time's up, Ekaril.
How's the main Arume fleet?

00:14:15.014 --> 00:14:20.854
The fleet has descended as scheduled. There
are small-scale skirmishes at various locations.

00:14:21.824 --> 00:14:26.264
Pointless resistance.
Our mission is basically done.

00:14:27.464 --> 00:14:28.934
All that remains...

00:14:29.364 --> 00:14:33.264
...is to eliminate this contact telepathy data.

00:14:34.304 --> 00:14:36.964
Mobilize all operational fighters!

00:14:37.304 --> 00:14:38.274
Roger!

00:14:38.274 --> 00:14:42.404
Open all flight decks.
Execute attack program after take-off!

00:14:42.814 --> 00:14:45.614
Deploying all reserve fighters!

00:14:45.844 --> 00:14:47.814
Target: Surfacing Ship Five!

00:14:58.464 --> 00:15:02.554
Of course she was lonely.
Of course she was sad!

00:15:03.734 --> 00:15:06.294
Isn't that so, Hagino?

00:15:09.334 --> 00:15:10.234
Warning!

00:15:10.234 --> 00:15:12.234
Large-scale attack approaching overhead.

00:15:15.074 --> 00:15:16.734
Deploy maximum strength shield!

00:15:16.914 --> 00:15:17.684
Roger.

00:15:17.684 --> 00:15:19.644
Deploying maximum strength shield.

00:15:26.624 --> 00:15:27.754
Commander!

00:15:27.754 --> 00:15:29.744
We're losing power!

00:15:30.024 --> 00:15:31.754
We won't be able to stay afloat!

00:15:32.864 --> 00:15:35.054
Second and third waves approaching.

00:15:38.364 --> 00:15:41.464
Main generator hit. Energy output declining.

00:15:42.734 --> 00:15:45.074
Forth and fifth enemy waves approaching.

00:15:47.204 --> 00:15:48.734
The shield is breaking up.

00:15:50.674 --> 00:15:53.304
Warning. Two seconds until direct impact.

00:16:01.594 --> 00:16:03.214
Opening communication circuits.

00:16:04.894 --> 00:16:08.094
This is former Ship One Flight Chief, Azanael.

00:16:08.764 --> 00:16:10.994
I've assumed control of Novaal.

00:16:11.464 --> 00:16:14.164
Hurry up and surface,
you sorry excuse for a gunner!

00:16:15.204 --> 00:16:16.964
Shut up, lamebrain!

00:16:17.304 --> 00:16:22.004
You're a Novaal commander, aren't you?
Aren't you fighting the wrong side?

00:16:23.514 --> 00:16:27.174
I was fighting the wrong side...
seeking revenge from the wrong party!

00:16:29.154 --> 00:16:30.754
What're you waiting for!

00:16:30.754 --> 00:16:32.484
The next wave is coming any time now!

00:16:34.084 --> 00:16:35.284
What should we do?

00:16:36.094 --> 00:16:39.994
Looks like we're in luck.
Fire up lower thrusters.

00:16:40.194 --> 00:16:42.224
Shifting energy to thrusters.

00:16:42.834 --> 00:16:44.124
Surface vessel.

00:16:44.304 --> 00:16:45.594
Surfacing.

00:16:52.774 --> 00:16:55.604
Thruster output stabilized.
Prepared for targeting.

00:16:56.044 --> 00:16:57.874
Rotate left 90 degrees.

00:16:57.944 --> 00:16:59.474
Set sights on Novaal.

00:16:59.584 --> 00:17:01.544
Roger. Setting sights on Novaal.

00:17:02.584 --> 00:17:04.444
Hagino!

00:17:22.304 --> 00:17:25.374
Hagino!

00:17:25.374 --> 00:17:28.364
It's her... Commander! It's her!

00:17:28.744 --> 00:17:30.174
It's Mari Wakatake!

00:17:32.984 --> 00:17:34.104
Mari...

00:17:35.014 --> 00:17:37.784
What... what's she saying?

00:17:40.554 --> 00:17:43.684
I'm not done talking with you!

00:17:47.364 --> 00:17:48.554
I'm going on ahead!

00:18:18.964 --> 00:18:20.484
Aiming complete.

00:18:22.934 --> 00:18:23.434
Blue...

00:18:23.434 --> 00:18:24.064
You're still there, aren't you?
Blue...

00:18:24.064 --> 00:18:26.764
You're still there, aren't you?

00:18:27.604 --> 00:18:29.864
You can hear me, can't you?

00:18:33.874 --> 00:18:34.964
Forward!

00:18:37.574 --> 00:18:40.274
Oh, Joan! Speak to me, Joan!

00:18:40.914 --> 00:18:42.114
Joan!

00:18:42.614 --> 00:18:45.244
I can still see you!

00:18:45.654 --> 00:18:50.614
Both thrusters full power. Aim for Novaal.

00:18:51.894 --> 00:18:55.694
Aiming for Novaal. Roger!

00:18:55.894 --> 00:18:58.764
Your form, your smile...

00:18:58.764 --> 00:18:59.364
Mari...
Your form, your smile...

00:18:59.364 --> 00:19:00.064
Mari...

00:19:08.574 --> 00:19:10.234
Joan!

00:19:10.714 --> 00:19:12.734
Oh, Joan!

00:19:28.894 --> 00:19:30.334
Hagino...

00:19:38.374 --> 00:19:39.804
What are you doing?!

00:19:39.904 --> 00:19:41.814
You still haven't regained control?!

00:19:41.814 --> 00:19:42.844
We're working on it,

00:19:42.844 --> 00:19:44.574
but it isn't responding!

00:19:45.244 --> 00:19:49.414
Then we'll burn them up!
Execute genocide mode!

00:19:50.054 --> 00:19:51.114
Onomil...

00:19:52.284 --> 00:19:54.984
Revenge, at long last...

00:19:55.454 --> 00:19:56.514
What?!

00:20:04.604 --> 00:20:06.094
What's this?

00:20:08.974 --> 00:20:10.194
Genocide?!

00:20:15.374 --> 00:20:18.274
Novaal entering genocide mode.

00:20:19.884 --> 00:20:20.904
Drat!

00:20:21.084 --> 00:20:22.944
We're out of energy...

00:20:23.314 --> 00:20:24.254
Tsubael.

00:20:25.384 --> 00:20:26.444
Yes?

00:20:29.124 --> 00:20:31.684
Thank you so much

00:20:32.724 --> 00:20:33.924
for everything that you've done.

00:20:36.064 --> 00:20:39.464
What... what are you doing, Commander?

00:20:41.134 --> 00:20:43.624
Commander! Please stop!

00:20:44.004 --> 00:20:45.094
Commander!

00:20:46.444 --> 00:20:48.464
Commander!

00:20:54.954 --> 00:20:56.784
Surrounding airspace has been cleared.

00:20:57.554 --> 00:20:59.244
One vessel remaining.

00:20:59.984 --> 00:21:02.474
There's no escaping now.

00:21:04.794 --> 00:21:07.284
You're done for, Azanael.

00:21:07.864 --> 00:21:09.524
Charging MB Blasters!

00:21:20.004 --> 00:21:23.104
Onomil... I'm sorry!

00:21:45.764 --> 00:21:49.634
"No matter what blade thou might posses,
thou shalt not cut...

00:21:50.474 --> 00:21:54.704
The rose that blooms in the
wilderness that is my home."

00:21:57.314 --> 00:21:59.804
The rose's name is Joan.

00:22:01.884 --> 00:22:04.784
Hagino Senkoji.

00:22:17.294 --> 00:22:18.564
Joan...

00:22:21.604 --> 00:22:26.634
You who spread seeds of hope in the world...

00:22:45.564 --> 00:22:48.224
A drop in the ocean.

00:22:57.374 --> 00:23:00.204
It's been thirty years now.

00:23:01.874 --> 00:23:05.574
And the curtain is finally falling on this war...

00:23:06.344 --> 00:23:13.014
No. The curtain has only just risen.

00:23:14.584 --> 00:23:18.764
Attention Arume Orbiting Mothership.
This is the UN Peace Delegation.

00:23:18.764 --> 00:23:20.664
Requesting permission to dock.

00:23:20.864 --> 00:23:25.864
Getour to Shator! Quit fluttering around!
How the heck am I supposed to escort you?!

00:23:25.864 --> 00:23:28.874
Shut up! Do your job and quit complaining!

00:23:28.874 --> 00:23:31.164
What did you say?

00:23:31.604 --> 00:23:35.874
Attention Arume Orbiting Mothership.
This is the Kozuki Official Peace Delegation.

00:23:36.314 --> 00:23:38.004
Requesting permission to dock.

00:23:39.544 --> 00:23:41.414
Everything will be all right.

00:23:42.684 --> 00:23:44.374
I'm sure of it.

00:23:59.034 --> 00:24:06.494
Standing side by side, hand in hand, by the sky

00:24:07.304 --> 00:24:17.354
Pledging our futures to the horizon

00:24:17.354 --> 00:24:25.024
A gentle breeze blowing

00:24:25.724 --> 00:24:33.604
As we melted into tomorrow

00:24:34.204 --> 00:24:37.804
The passing time

00:24:37.804 --> 00:24:43.144
Quietly watches over you

00:24:43.344 --> 00:24:47.084
Our sadness, our good-byes

00:24:47.084 --> 00:24:52.574
And our blue tears all make us stronger

00:24:53.924 --> 00:24:58.224
We sour after our dreams like budding flowers

00:24:58.224 --> 00:25:03.064
Searching for answers in life

00:25:03.064 --> 00:25:07.364
Always believing in the day

00:25:07.364 --> 00:25:13.074
We'll proudly unfurl our petals

00:25:13.074 --> 00:25:17.034
In the blue dreams!
